---
description: Query the Graphify vault graph first; record token savings on every ask
alwaysApply: true
---

Vault / decision / "what connects X to Y?" questions: run the wrapper, not a vault grep first.

```text
py -3 tools/graphify_ask.py query "<question>"
py -3 tools/graphify_ask.py path "A" "B"
py -3 tools/graphify_ask.py explain "Concept"
py -3 tools/graphify_ask.py status
```

MUST keep the `graphify_usage ... total_saved=` footer. That number is cited-note tokens avoided minus query tokens. If it stays 0, delete Graphify.

Do not read the graphify rebuild skill unless rebuilding. ADRs live in `architecture/decisions/` -- this graph does not contain them.
